yle  chao gar is a more rare form of martial  arts  it's tougher and works better for short  range fighting  the choreographers thought that this  would be appropriate for toff because  unlike the other earthbenders we see in  the show she's blind  and frankly your earthbending could  still use some work too  this will really make you watch the show  differently check out the concepts that  the show started with  before making massive changes to create  what we know and love today  first let's start with how different  aang momo and appa looked  this is what the creators originally  came up with momo looks like some kind  of robot and oppa looks more like a big  dog than a bison  we can't imagine what the show would be  like if the showrunners had stuck with  these character designs  another big change the creators made  happened in uncle iro instead of being  the lovable  wise and kind man we know he was almost  a hardened war  general can you picture how different  the show would be  lastly let's talk about toff did you  know that originally she was supposed to  be a big bulky man  that's right think of the boulder  another avatar character fans love  imagine toff looking like that of course  they do make a joke about it in the  ember island players episode when toff  is portrayed as a big man what you  thinking about  one of the best parts of avatar the last  airbender is the characters themselves  what would the show be without aang's  optimism and saka's humor  they wouldn't be the characters we know  and love without the people voicing them  alright here's the deal aang is voiced  by zach tyler eisen  his voice is perfect for the character  who balances being mature and  being a goofy kid katara was brought to  life by mae whitman  she made sure to bring katara's motherly  instinct and strong character to the  forefront when voicing the character  sukkah's voice came from jack desenna we  were surprised to learn that saka wasn't  originally meant to be the humorous guy  we love  the creators had intended him to be more  serious but when jack desenna started  recording for the character  he brought some funny attributes to the  character  find by me if you're not gonna do your  job  zuko is voiced by dante bosco now we all  started off against zuko  since he was only after aang but as the  show went on  we learned his backstory and we watched  one of the best redemption arcs of  all time unfold he's a fan favorite for  sure  this is what basco had to say about  voicing the character  act from my heart and hopefully the  voice lands in the right place  toff's voice is provided by jessie  flower we all know  top as the best earth bender of all time  but what does the woman who voices her  think  during a panel someone asked flower what  her favorite line to record was  as you might have guessed i am not top i  am melon we  love avatar the last airbender for so  many reasons  from the animated perfection to the  gripping story to the characters we know  and love the show is practically perfect  which behind the scenes moments  surprised you the most be sure to let us  know down in the comments  thanks for watching
 

